==English==

===Alternative spellings ===
*[[whuffo]]

===Etymology===
Said to come from the phrase "what for you jump out of that airplane?"

===Pronunciation===
woo' foe

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
# {{slang}} A person who is not a [[skydiver]].  
#:''It annoys me when a '''wuffo''' asks about the safety record of sky-diving; if it weren't good, people wouldn't do it.''